CM_ SG_ 382 EPS_LatCtrlAvailabilityStatus "CESHI hengxiang kongzhi keji zhuangtai (EPS lat ctrl availability, byte6 bits7,6, 01.csv zhiqu {0,1}, 0=83% 1=17%)";
